Package: kmod-keys-encrypted
Version: 5.15.150-1
Depends: kernel (=5.15.150-1-c91268e66e66b4987a4ca258e683db91), kmod-crypto-cbc, kmod-crypto-hmac, kmod-crypto-rng, kmod-crypto-sha256, kmod-keys-trusted
